<title>UK: World Bank sets 15 bln peseta three-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 15 bln peseta three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers BSN and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    09.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.02    PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     DENOMS     100	 LISTING     MADRID</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
